RewriteRule ^assets/video/mp4/promo-main-reel-(?:3c92641df748-)?(720|1080|2160)\.mp4$ https://luxuryband.ru/assets/video/mp4/promo-main-reel-4ef6085a27d4-$1.mp4 [L,R=301,NE,QSD]
